      },
      {
        "id": "textbook-tophat",
        "moduleId": "derived-operators",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "顶帽：原图减开运算",
        "markdown": "顶帽（Top Hat）是**输入图像与它的开运算结果之差**。教材示例使用 9×9 的核：\n\n```python\ntophat = cv.morphologyEx(img, cv.MORPH_TOPHAT, kernel)\n```",
        "provenance": {
