      {
        "id": "textbook-blackhat",
        "moduleId": "derived-operators",
        "depth": "core",
        "kind": "mechanism",
        "title": "黑帽：闭运算减原图",
        "markdown": "黑帽（Black Hat）是**输入图像的闭运算结果与原图之差**：\n\n```python\nblackhat = cv.morphologyEx(img, cv.MORPH_BLACKHAT, kernel)\n```",
        "provenance": {
